70
00:06:45,530 --> 00:06:47,530
Husten?

71
00:06:47,530 --> 00:06:48,530
Husten, ja.

72
00:06:48,530 --> 00:06:49,530
Husten, ja.

73
00:06:49,530 --> 00:06:57,260
